From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: minhmc2007 <quangminh21072010@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 11:47:07 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] drm-ffi: set the point field drm_syncobj_handle now has

error[E0063]: missing field `point` in initializer of
`drm_sys::drm_syncobj_handle`
  --> crates/drm-ffi/src/syncobj.rs:48:20

drm-ffi is 0.9.0 but its Cargo.toml pins drm-sys 0.8.0, and the drm-sys
that actually gets used declares a `point` field the 0.9.0 source does
not set. drm-ffi never reads it, so zero is correct; it is a u64, not a
pointer.

Change-Id: I6b38cc192b4340a69198e9033a9b8375039cce82
---
 crates/drm-ffi/src/syncobj.rs | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/crates/drm-ffi/src/syncobj.rs b/crates/drm-ffi/src/syncobj.rs
index 5334944d..b1cee07e 100644
--- a/crates/drm-ffi/src/syncobj.rs
+++ b/crates/drm-ffi/src/syncobj.rs
@@ -54,6 +54,7 @@ pub fn handle_to_fd(
         },
         fd: 0,
         pad: 0,
+        point: 0,
     };
 
     unsafe {
@@ -78,6 +79,7 @@ pub fn fd_to_handle(
         },
         fd: syncobj_fd.as_raw_fd(),
         pad: 0,
+        point: 0,
     };
 
     unsafe {
